    m1 line 324 encryptFileWithRecipient        perm -> 0644
    m2 line 369 decryptFileWithIdentity         perm -> 0644
    m3 lines 411/413 rollbackEncryptionWithIdentity  perm -> 0644
    m4 lines 486/488 rollbackDecryptionWithRecipient perm -> 0644
  (`_ = perm` / `_, err :=` added only to keep the compiler quiet about the now-unused
  variable; `go build ./internal/services/storage/` succeeds in each.)
  `go test -count=1 -v -run '<the five mode tests>' ./internal/services/storage/` per copy:
    m1: --- FAIL: TestEncryptFileWithRecipientPreservesMode
        "migration_perm_test.go:66: encryptFileWithRecipient changed mode 0600 -> -rw-r--r--"
        other four tests PASS
    m2: --- FAIL: TestDecryptFileWithIdentityPreservesMode
        "migration_perm_test.go:108: decryptFileWithIdentity changed mode 0600 -> -rw-r--r--"
        other four tests PASS
    m3: --- FAIL: TestRollbackEncryptionWithIdentityPreservesMode
        "migration_perm_test.go:149: rollbackEncryptionWithIdentity changed mode 0600 -> -rw-r--r--"
