      PASS, nonroot_exit=0
  Race, as `nobody` in /tmp/claude-0/f4-nr:
      go test -race -count=1 -timeout 1200s ./internal/services/storage/
      -> "ok  budget2/internal/services/storage  1036.428s", race_exit=0  (no races)
  gofmt, in /home/user/simplebudget on the two manifest files:
